{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門海華路11號一個回收場發生火警。今日（13日）下午1時27分，警方接報回收場冒煙，據報有廢鐵着火。消防派出一喉一煙帽隊灌救，救護車在場戒備，暫時未有受傷報告。</p><p>由網上圖片可見，現場冒出濃煙直沖上半空，遠處亦可看見。</p><figure><img alt=\"濃煙直冒上半空。（Threads/tommytigerisflying截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186677336456564736802473.jpeg/hoNp4w19QPiz5PGhnNN2tO9Cb4MCbyyUt7anzbe2p80\"/><figcaption>濃煙直冒上半空。（Threads/tommytigerisflying截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:20:41.792084+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:17:43.259801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:17:43.259801+00:00","content_hash":"2fc693e9a0173930829d04a0eb324119a89bb70b99ace9c608b4d5d203a192df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}